    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n83364" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῐτῠό-εις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εσσα</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>abounding in pine-trees</i> :—only as pr. n.
				<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πιτυοῦς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οῦντος</span>, ὁ, a town
			on the N<i><span class="en">
				E.
			</span></i> coast of the Euxine, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				11.2.14
			</span></i>; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πιτυοῦσσαι</span></b> , αἱ, two islands off the coast of Spain,
				<i>Ebusus (Iviza)</i> and <i>Ophiussa (Formentera)</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				3.5.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῐτῠοῦσσα</span></b> , ἡ, <i>quacksalver's spurge, Euphorbia
				Pityusa</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.165
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				24.31
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				7.26.37
			</span></i>.</div>
